    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have a creature grabbed or restrained with your wings.</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">When a creature is trapped around your wings, they are at your mercy. Attempt to Grapple the grabbed creature. On a success, instead of remaining Grabbed they become Restrained. If they were already restrained, you deal damage to them as if you had successfully made a Bite attack while they were off-guard, and become grabbed or restrained according to the regular outcomes of a Grapple action. On a failure or critical failure, resolve the outcome as normal for Grapple.</span></p>"
